<pubdate>1995</pubdate>
<title>
Velocities of outlet glaciers, ice streams, and ice
shelves, Antarctica, from satellite images
</title>
<pubinfo>
<pubplace>Flagstaff, Arizona</pubplace>
<publish>U.S. Geological Survey</publish>
</pubinfo>
<othercit>
